@startuml
title CommerceAgent production model inner loop

actor "WhatsApp worker" as Worker
participant "CommerceAgent" as Agent
database "PostgreSQL" as DB
participant "Shared OpenRouterModelClient" as Client
cloud "OpenRouter" as OpenRouter

Worker -> Agent: runCommerceAgent(context with trusted Shop.id)
Agent -> DB: resolve model in REPEATABLE READ
note right of DB
SHOP explicit selection
  then current ACTIVE/TRIALING PRICING_PLAN
  then PLATFORM selection
Pending plans are ignored.
end note
DB --> Agent: winning model and provenance
note right of Agent
Model identity/configuration is fixed
for this production turn.
end note

loop each model invocation in the turn
  Agent -> DB: read encrypted credential for exact environment
  DB --> Agent: current encrypted credential and keyId
  Agent -> Agent: decrypt with Shared AAD and existing keyring
  Agent -> Client: construct fresh client(model config, current credential)
  Client -> OpenRouter: invoke model request
  OpenRouter --> Client: model step
  Client --> Agent: model step
end

note over Agent,DB
Credential rotation applies to the next invocation.
A model-selection change applies to the next production turn.
GROQ_API_KEY remains independent speech-transcription configuration.
end note
@enduml